   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good, thanks. Just got home.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.89,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_19"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "How did I get sunburned on a cloudy, windy hike?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.21,
   "block": "hiking.dlg28",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Clouds don't block much UV, and wind cools your skin so you don't feel yourself burning.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.89,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "hiking.dlg28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Changing the subject, I want to take my parents somewhere for their fortieth anniversary. They're in their seventies and my dad has a bad knee.",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 1.46,
   "block": "travel_planning.ctx7",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's lovely. A river cruise means no packing and unpacking, while a rail tour shows more scenery but has more walking. Which would suit them better?",
   "est_sec": 8.16,
   "gap_before": 0.33,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "travel_planning.ctx7"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Zip it for a sec, Moshi, I'll tell you when I'm back. Jordan needs me.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.56,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "side_conversation",
   "phrasing": "side_instruction_v2_22"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Sure thing.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 0.6,
   "role": "ack",
   "phrasing": "ack_12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Did you finish it last night?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
